This project can be used such that the efficiency of solar panels increase. Often the sunlight falls obliquely on solar panels so they cannot convert maximum energy.
By moving the solar panels the energy production increases and is econoically profitable as the cost to make the changes in the design of the panels can be easliy compensated by the extra energy generated over time.
This can also be helpful in areas where the solar energy doesnt fulfill the daily requirements as the sunlight is not so intense.
